    "text": "IT is hereby notified that His Excellency the President in the exercise of powers conferred upon him under the Constitutionof the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, has removed Hon. Ranil Wickremasinghe, who was appointed byHis Excellency the President under Article 42(4) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lankafrom the office of the Prime Minister of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, with immediate effect.",
